      "A2 multilingual DistilBERT exceeds A1 TF-IDF LR in AUPRC on both reciprocal source-held-out folds and has lower Brier/ECE15.",
      "A1 conservative locked threshold remains below 1% empirical FPR on both development sources with non-zero recall.",
      "A2 conservative absolute threshold satisfies the FPR constraint but collapses to zero recall on TREC5; this is a score-scale/calibration transport failure, not a rank-performance failure.",
